+    Pillars (Generic Phonetic Alignment):
+    1. Strict Entity Immunity: Never corrupts brand names, acronyms, proper nouns, or ITN numbers.
+    2. Phonetic Distance Bounded Substitution: Replaces non-entity single tokens if edit distance <= 2.
+    3. Flanked Omitted Syllable Recovery: Restores missing single syllables flanked by matching context.
